 destroy your Base.\n\n[How to Play]\nUse your hand or a controller to play!\nPress the button, pick up the units and release them in the map!\nThe left and right sticks allow you to move the user's position slightly.\n\n[Type of Units]\n-Base\nThis is the Base.\nBuild your Base stronger!!\n\n-Fighter\nA common flying unit.\nGround & Air Attack.\n\n-Factory\nA factory unit.\nIt generates cash.\n\n-Bomber\nA flying unit skilled for\nbombing and ground attack.\n\n-Tank\nAn anti-ground unit.\nAttacks with rapid fire.\n\n-Anti-aircraft Artillery\nA placement unit using missles.\nEffective to flying units.\n\n-Sheild\nA placement unit for defense.\nIt has high durability.\n", "short_description": "Let's play a VR video game with your girl friend!\nThis time it's a strategy game.\nPick up the units and release them in the map.\nThe units will start fighting automatically."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Art_1008x1440.png", "id": "4244000545622202", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974522_4244000548955535_6121386002098751284_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PA-EWX_lf7kQ7kNvwFfsNso&_nc_oc=AdoEDtG8Jtl3YDKNWTJZaWVFFfLzPWRs22VG6vaiLohZhCth-jCybcQVAZp9DBsTOPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7u34NeOPnzyNdXLz0_yU7x626kYwTl_wIEPfo4Yjueog&oe=6A0F08C5"}, {"file_name": "Art_2560x1440.png", "id": "3609745079249612", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974800_3609745082582945_8822499596742085698_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wPNN8e05zMQQ7kNvwHlkunR&_nc_oc=Adpr-wN3Oox0HFksge4tz2KzwnAmDcC_4N-LudztsU3zZYK7_DbXE-A3coq9IqUFZq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6CwpJt-MyJoUM4XZJONri2N4uc5kKZzx1yBipY5NJQtg&oe=6A0F008C"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512_JP.png", "id": "1572766619588975", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculus